cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'Writing Reconstruction Algorithms in EICrecon (ePIC tutorial)'
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson using the information in this file
  when you refer to it in publications, and/or if you
  re-use, adapt, or expand on the content in your own
  training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Tyler
    family-names: Kutz
  - name: The ePIC Collaboration
abstract: >-
  An ePIC tutorial on implementing reconstruction algorithms in EICrecon. It
  covers JANA2 factories, the JOmniFactory interface, parameterizing factories,
  writing framework-independent algorithms, and working with PODIO collections,
  culminating in a working electron-finder. Built with The Carpentries Workbench.
keywords:
  - EIC
  - ePIC
  - EICrecon
  - reconstruction
  - JANA2
  - JOmniFactory
  - PODIO
  - edm4eic
repository-code: 'https://github.com/eic/tutorial-reconstruction-algorithms'
